2 CONT EVERY INDIVIDUAL AND FAMILY CARRIES AN EVIDENCE GRADE IN ITS NOTE:
2 CONT   CONFIRMED  - supported by a primary or near-primary record (death certificate, census, marriage record, funeral-home obituary, or a photographed headstone).
2 CONT   PROBABLE   - a strong circumstantial case, but no clinching document.
2 CONT   LEAD ONLY  - taken from user-submitted online trees. NOT PROOF. A research target.
2 CONT 
2 CONT Do not promote a relationship from PROBABLE to CONFIRMED without a primary document. Online family trees, Find a Grave biography text, and Find a Grave family links are all user-entered and are not
2 CONC primary documents.
2 CONT 
2 CONT Living persons are recorded by name and relationship only.
